      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is still true.\nBecause of all those random instances with one AFK person in them, etc.\nI still think the heuristic for listing instances is not great. Work could be done to show more active instances than it does right now.\nIf there is a world with 20 instances all with 15/20 people in them. They should all be shown IMO. I think full instances should be indicated too.\nCulling the noise of old instances with just 1 or two people in them sounds great.",
